#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, alignToGrid)
#. +> trunk stable
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:317
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the icons to be arranged in a grid.\n"
"\n"
"When this option is checked, icons will automatically snap to the nearest grid cell when you move them around in the view."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de Lüttbiller na en Gadder utrichten wullt.\n"
"\n"
"Is dit anmaakt, backt Lüttbiller bi't Bewegen binnen de Ansicht automaatsch an't neegste Gadderkrüüz."

